#NEXUS

[ rauhut2017a_fig10: Theropod summary tree 2, root at the bottom. Averostra, Tetanurae and Avetheropoda, printed beside node dots, are kept as internal labels. Fully resolved. 9 tips, fully resolved; 3 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=9;
    TAXLABELS
        Dilophosaurus
        Ceratosauria
        Chilesaurus
        Pandoravenator
        Condorraptor
        Piatnitzkysaurus
        Spinosauroidea
        Allosauroidea
        Coelurosauria
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE rauhut2017a_fig10 = [&R] (Dilophosaurus,(Ceratosauria,(Chilesaurus,(Pandoravenator,((Condorraptor,Piatnitzkysaurus),(Spinosauroidea,(Allosauroidea,Coelurosauria)Avetheropoda))))Tetanurae)Averostra);
END;
